<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-command-surface> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Expose census, status and aliases through one static providers command family with bounded filters, stable JSON, explicit effects and no ad hoc operational script dependency. Reserve providers receipt acquire and verify as a graph-registered proofblocked leaf whose implementation can be added in its independently owned module without reopening the shared dispatcher or help registry." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
