<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-token-reduction> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Compare equivalent accepted semantic workloads against a frozen baseline and report gross, useful, cached and avoided tokens, cache reuse, yield and elapsed throughput; exact scoped semantic identities key disposable repository-local cache state and cache loss changes performance only." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
