<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-test-economics> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Use one table-driven pure provider matrix and one fixture-backed command chain, keep live provider calls out of the default suite, reuse scale and metrics coverage, and prune subsumed assertions rather than multiplying tests per provider or model." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
