<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-model-local-currentness> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Keep availability, quota, cooldown, catalogue metadata, account receipt, adapter, assessment and qualification currentness model-local and durable; disappearance, restoration, expiry, metadata change or provider failure invalidates only the exact affected identity and never poisons a sibling route or fabricates healthy state." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
