<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-useful-token-accounting> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Treat missing usage, price, cache-read weight or cache-write evidence as unknown rather than zero; credit useful progress only for accepted deterministic validation, report gross and effective cost separately from target progress, and reduce utility for unnecessary tokens without rewarding unvalidated claims." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
