<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-provider-posture> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Carry an explicit provider mode, lifecycle state and readiness disposition for every route; keep health separate from authority, make unknown and revoked fail closed, and permit live-external-authorised only from current route-scoped authority and evidence. A mock, local, composed, deferred, healthy or historically configured provider never implies live readiness." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
