<urn:usf:requirement:provider-pipeline-port-isolation> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Make the provider boundary a typed USF port: core scheduling, routing and API surfaces depend only on the port; provider SDK imports and provider-specific response translation remain inside the content-verified adapter child; fixture fakes remain test-only and cannot satisfy live evidence." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
