<urn:usf:acceptance:provider-adapter-preflight> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "The exact selected adapter is content verified and the scrubbed child proves fixed-origin, selected-variable-only, bounded zero-paid request construction before any authenticated answer request." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:acceptance:provider-authenticated-answers> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:AcceptanceCriterion> <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
<urn:usf:acceptance:provider-authenticated-answers> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Each selected route returns current provider-produced qualification answers with verified actual identity, usage and zero-paid observations, or a sanitized model-local explicit failure, under the immutable effective policy, call-time authorization, admitted receipt and adapter basis; missing or substituted identity stops without fallback." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
