<urn:usf:acceptance:provider-parallel-execution> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "The reusable no-contact runtime fixture-validates bounded independent concurrency, immutable baseline/candidate receipt handling, exact token accounting and absence of a Docker, GitHub or global mutation-lock dependency." <urn:usf:graph:provider-pipeline> .
